    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Contains command classes which may interact with an index / the network.

Unlike its sister module, req_command, this module still uses lazy imports
so commands which don&apos;t always hit the network (e.g. list w/o --outdated or
--uptodate) don&apos;t need waste time importing PipSession and friends.
</verbatim> </para>
